      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 385: 🔴 The `\u003c\u003d 16 MB` guard is applied **after** `sendGetRequest` has already fetched the full response into memory (`const QByteArray\u0026 data`). A crafted clipboard `\u003cimg\u003e` URL can therefore force large downloads and memory pressure despite the intended cap. Enforce the limit during transfer (abort when content-length or streamed bytes exceed 16 MB) in `NetworkManager`/request code, rather than post-download.",
